557 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The operator checks if it is a busy day, such as during peak hours or special events. If so, the customer is informed about potential delivery delays. Once delivery times are agreed upon, the order is finalized and marked as ready for fulfillment. This concludes the phone-based order process, ensuring seamless communication and preparation for subsequent delivery stages.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
