<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText ( If the address is not appropriate for the store, the system checks if the order can be directed to another store. If there is a nearer store that can handle the order, the order is canceled at the current store, and the customer is invited to visit or place an order with the appropriate store. If no nearby store can fulfill the order because it falls outside the delivery area, the order is canceled outright. This concludes the website-based order registration process.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
