/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The Why-Why Analysis is a problem-solving tool used to identify the root causes of inefficiencies and issues within the Order-to-Cash \(O2C\) process at Home Burger. By repeatedly asking "Why?" for each identified problem, we can trace its origins and uncover deeper, systemic causes that might otherwise go unnoticed.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
796 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (This method helps move beyond surface-level symptoms and provides actionable insights for addressing challenges such as delays, errors, and non-value-adding activities. Each diagram represents a structured breakdown of an issue, leading to the identification of root causes and opportunities for improvement. These insights will inform the redesign of the O2C process to improve efficiency, reduce costs, and enhance customer satisfaction.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [1]
>>
