/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The Quantitative Analysis evaluates the Order-to-Cash \(O2C\) process at Home Burger using measurable data to identify inefficiencies and assess performance. By analyzing metrics such as process times, waiting times, resource utilization, and costs, this section provides a detailed understanding of how effectively the current process operates.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
812 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The analysis includes key performance indicators such as average processing times, bottlenecks, and task completion rates. Simulation results are also incorporated to evaluate resource allocation, identify areas of overutilization or underutilization, and test potential improvements.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
