<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The monthly salary for the website employee is 1500 euros. The employee works 5 hours per day, 7 days a week, over 4 weeks in a month, the total number of working hours is 140 \(calculated as 5 hours per day multiplied by 7 days per week, then multiplied by 4 weeks\).)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
1224 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Dividing the monthly salary by the total number of hours worked:)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
1225 0 obj
<<
