>>
endobj
1546 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The monthly salary for a full-time position is 1500 euros. Assuming the employee works 8 hours per day, 7 days a week, over 4 weeks in a month, the total number of working hours is 224 \(calculated as 8 hours per day multiplied by 7 days per week, then multiplied by 4 weeks\).)
/Alt ()
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
