/ActualText (In this scenario, the percentage of customers already registered decreased to 20%, while the percentage of customers wanting to register increased to 50%. The process was executed for 39 instances, leading to an increase in the average process time to 285.55 seconds \(approximately 4.76 minutes\) compared to the AS-IS scenario.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 48 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
