1735 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The total process time for fulfilling these 39 orders increased to 11,136.48 seconds \(approximately 185.61 minutes\). The in-store receptionist's utilization also rose to 39.29%, reflecting the increased workload.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 48 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
1736 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Despite the longer process time, waiting times remained negligible, indicating that the system can handle the higher demand efficiently. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 48 0 R
/K [5]
>>
