/ActualText (The addition of one kitchen staff member significantly reduced task durations and minimized waiting times for critical tasks like Order Prepared. This change enhanced workflow efficiency, reduced potential bottlenecks, and provided enough capacity to handle peak demand effectively. While the improvement in overall process time was modest, the impact on specific tasks was substantial, improving overall performance.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 54 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
