/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText ( The overall average process time in Scenario 4 increased slightly to 2712.32 seconds \(45.2 minutes\) from 2435.73 seconds \(40.6 minutes\) in Scenario 3. This reflects the impact of reallocating managerial tasks to packagers and the receptionist.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 60 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
