2816 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In the To-Be process for phone orders, the integration of the Toast POS system revolutionizes how customer interactions and order management are conducted. When a call is received, the Toast system identifies whether the phone number is already registered in its database. If the caller is recognized, their profile and order history are automatically retrieved, enabling operators to handle the call with minimal input from the customer. This significantly reduces the time required for customer verification and enhances the overall experience.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 65 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
2817 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (For new callers, the system prompts operators to collect and register essential information, including the customer's name, address, and contact details, ensuring a smooth onboarding process. For returning customers using a new phone number, Toast allows operators to merge the new details with an existing profile, maintaining a consistent and accurate database. This seamless integration eliminates data duplication and reduces errors in customer records.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 65 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
2818 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (A further enhancement is the direct connection of Toast with store-specific data, ensuring that customers are routed to the correct location. If a customer contacts a store that is not the closest to their address, the system automatically transfers the order or directs the call to the appropriate store. Additionally, for unanswered calls, Toast can be configured to trigger automated follow-up messages or emails, ensuring no customer inquiry goes unaddressed.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 65 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
2819 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (By adopting Toast POS, the organization implements a comprehensive and scalable solution that integrates phone orders, in-store operations, and delivery management into a single platform. The system eliminates manual inefficiencies, improves accuracy, and enhances customer satisfaction through its automation capabilities. The Toast Essentials Plan costs $165/month for three phone operators and includes tools for caller identification, customer data retrieval, and efficient order processing. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 65 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
