2826 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Automation within Toast POS ensures that all steps, from order placement to fulfillment, occur seamlessly. The system handles address verification, store assignment, and customer notifications without the need for manual input, significantly reducing processing times and errors. Customers receive real-time updates about their order status, improving satisfaction and trust in the process.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 66 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
