2841 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In the To-Be process for order processing, Toast POS is integrated to streamline workflows, automate tasks, and enhance operational efficiency. Orders are automatically directed to the Kitchen Display System, eliminating the need for manual communication and ensuring that kitchen staff receives real-time updates. Delivery routing is also automated, leveraging tools like Google Maps to assign optimal routes for couriers based on their location and the delivery destination. This reduces delays and improves overall delivery accuracy.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 68 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
