/K [5]
>>
endobj
2845 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText ( Additionally, the manager role has been eliminated, with responsibilities redistributed to other staff and automated systems, ensuring a leaner and more efficient process. Dedicated smartphones for couriers, connected to the Toast POS system, provide real-time order updates, delivery instructions, and communication channels, ensuring seamless coordination between couriers and the store. Automating these tasks reduces errors, enhances delivery efficiency, and improves customer satisfaction.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 69 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
2846 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (This automated process eliminates the need for manual intervention in order management, routing, and communication, significantly reducing errors and processing times. Key heuristics such as Automation, Resource Optimization, and Communication Optimization are applied to streamline tasks, enhance collaboration between departments, and improve the customer experience. While the initial investment includes hardware and setup costs, the operational efficiencies and scalability provided by this system ensure long-term value for the business.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 69 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
