2850 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The To-Be process models represent a streamlined and automated approach to the Home Burger Lisbon Center's operations, addressing inefficiencies and resource bottlenecks identified in the As-Is analysis. By leveraging advanced systems such as Toast POS and automation through API integrations, the To-Be processes aim to enhance customer satisfaction, reduce processing times, and optimize resource utilization. This section provides a qualitative analysis of the proposed processes, highlighting improvements in workflow efficiency, task allocation, and overall operational effectiveness compared to the As-Is models.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 70 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
